[{"id":3134006656,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc66zSWA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it mostly works as expected in all rendering methods.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_lightmap_directional_specular_lobe.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21871726/test_lightmap_directional_specular_lobe.zip)\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- This does a pretty good job overall, although there are some inherent limitations to the technique when multiple light sources contribute to a single luxel significantly. You may see the specular lobe appear to warp around when the camera moves, or become shorter than expected (e.g. if two light sources are placed close enough and you look at both from an oblique angle). Still, even with these limitations in mind, this is overall a big visual upgrade in scenes with static light baking.\r\n\r\n- If you notice specular lobes looking wobbly, make sure denoising is enabled and bake quality is high enough.\r\n\r\n- Some light colors won't reflect specular light correctly:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bf4f72a-2e15-4658-a21c-d0b5b44714d3\r\n\r\nIf you look closer, you'll see the separation clearly:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1236\" height=\"412\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c3e4d7a-9b31-4e33-8941-4226e0613b24\" />\r\n\r\nIf you look in the opposite direction, you'll see there *is* actually a specular lobe for these colors, but it's in the wrong direction and much more diffuse:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3cf947e3-ede5-4c79-ad59-ac350f6c4f3c\r\n\r\nThis affects both omni and spot lights, probably directional lights as well.\r\n\r\n- Environment lighting will leak through lit areas:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a914684d-f128-4a5b-9b92-9db06a82ee36\r\n\r\nThis reflects real-time environment light, so the issue will appear as soon as you change the black sky in the MRP for a different sky (even if you don't rebake lightmaps).\r\n\r\n- In the MRP, specular light appears much stronger with the DirectionalLight3D in static bake mode compared to the Dynamic bake mode:\r\n\r\nDynamic bake mode | Static bake mode\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1051\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250820_000319\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/863313b0-8638-4352-968f-6022ccad7c5b\" /> | <img width=\"1919\" height=\"1051\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250820_000302\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94f29455-b149-4f09-be17-2b8499be6ca0\" />\r\n\r\n- There should be a property in LightmapGI to adjust the specular intensity (or a project setting if that's not feasible), as you can't adjust it on a per-light basis with this approach and it can get too strong for certain art styles.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3134006656","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3134006656"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737"}},"submitted_at":"2025-08-19T22:18:42Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3165423452,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc68rIdc","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3165423452","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3165423452"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737"}},"submitted_at":"2025-08-28T15:28:50Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3553809333,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7T0tO1","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I gave this another try (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/757bba192ef4c3254b44bc0d2c8cf36aa3343e30) and it works great on all renderers now.\r\n\r\nThe only remaining issue is that the **Specular Intensity** property is part of LightmapGIData, which has two downsides:\r\n\r\n- It's difficult to discover as @passivestar pointed out.\r\n- The property's customized value is lost if you discard the LightmapGI Data resource for any reason. This will be an issue for implementing https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11110, or any other workflow where the LightmapGIData isn't persisted across machines.\r\n\r\nI suggest moving it out of LightmapGIData and into the LightmapGI node, so that it's at the same location as the **Directional** property (the property can be moved just below and have its visibility toggled based on the value of **Directional**).\r\n\r\nVoxelGIData also contains properties that affect rendering, but we should try to move away from that workflow in the long run.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3553809333","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3553809333"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737"}},"submitted_at":"2025-12-08T19:53:21Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3554406748,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7T2_Fc","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3554406748","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737#pullrequestreview-3554406748"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737"}},"submitted_at":"2025-12-08T22:49:46Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3554413294,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7T3Aru","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calino